<title>HONG KONG: Theme confirms Everbright-IHD interest.</title>
<headline>Theme confirms Everbright-IHD interest.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Theme International Holdings Ltd said it is in talks with China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd which could lead to Everbright-IHD taking a 20 percent stake in Theme and Theme taking over an Everbright-IHD unit.</p>
<p>If the deals went through, Everbright-IHD would subscribe for new Theme shares, and Theme would get from Everbright-IHD a majority equity interest in Emporium Holdings (Singapore) Ltd and receive a cash consideration of about HK$50 million, the company said in an announcement published on Friday.</p>
<p>Everbright-IHD holds 99 percent of the voting rights of Emporium.</p>
